## ===========================================================================
## SSHD Config Tampering — Splunk SPL
## ===========================================================================
## Maps to Sigma: sshd-config-tampering.yml
## Maps to MITRE: T1098.004, T1556
## Maps to NSM: 2.3, 3.2
##
## Assumptions:
##   - auditd watches deployed (see vps-bootstrap/scripts/00-bootstrap.sh)
##   - audit logs forwarded via Splunk Add-on for Linux Audit Daemon
##   - sourcetype=auditd or sourcetype=linux:audit
## ===========================================================================

index=linux sourcetype=linux:audit
    (key="sshd_config_change" OR key="sshd_hostkey_change")
| rex field=_raw "auid=(?<audit_uid>\d+)"
| rex field=_raw "comm=\"(?<process_name>[^\"]+)\""
| rex field=_raw "pid=(?<process_pid>\d+)"
| rex field=_raw "name=\"(?<file_path>[^\"]+)\""
| rex field=_raw "\bop=(?<operation>\w+)"
| where NOT (process_name IN ("ansible-config", "puppet"))
| table _time host audit_uid process_name process_pid file_path operation
| sort - _time
